# Generated per-run resolution receipts. The pipeline writes these next to
# each run and re-verifies them in place; they pin absolute paths into the
# already-ignored output/ and runs/ trees, so they are not portable. The
# hand-authored run specs (experiments/<family>/<name>.yaml) stay tracked.
experiments/**/manifest.yaml

